Sなどの宣伝\n\n参考：https://drive.google.com/file/d/1XsK6GVdUBtoXX_aMCGK88DPogpZ2Zr1r/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@illust__ai/works/44", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3644635, "client_id": 930267, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/54d9192f/uploads/origins/902ecbb5-2f02-4642-87ca-799c147871ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d3d6a17b4b4de9d38858e57f8d88c767", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/54d9192f/uploads/origins/902ecbb5-2f02-4642-87ca-799c147871ca?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8314c1b7d53e375973238dc611b9ab72", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hello! I was browsing and saw your beautiful artwork. I was inspired to make a request.\n\nWould you be alright drawing my Vtuber, Fiya? She is a mischievous and cheerful witch. She has two hairstyles. The artist can pick which hairstyle to draw.\n\nHair: Brown & Pink\nEyes: Pink\nCharm Point: Pink Polka Dots & Galaxy Design\n\nUsage:\n- SNS\n- YouTube Thumbnails\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1QVQxR3Q9nf4f9MxadF2Zc-dUd_Rq3M30/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@illust__ai/works/43", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3644635, "client_id": 3119116, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/bae0255e/uploads/origins/7d1b6eb4-a618-4c9f-9d54-a7171c346f27?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c188a0c8a769a19f0c1ac54323cd431f", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_t