carecrow farmer who is rather caring and loves plants, but a little bit clueless about life. She also has a crow friend (but you do not have to draw them if you do not want to!) Apart from that please feel free to draw her in whatever outfit and however you would like!\n\nI would like to use this on SNS, Twitch and/or possible Youtube singing cover, and would like a version with separated/transparent BG if possible!\n\nIf the amount is not enough, please feel free to appeal!\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1Wx5QfaVGKtQxvhbRvNuoc3qNsbvA-Q1K?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@illust__ai/works/30", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3644635, "client_id": 3639508, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/33ccbb53/uploads/origins/20780509-2a07-4f1e-b268-b801f7532fac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5ab4c208b245799801671c6a67c16d2b", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/33ccbb53/uploads/origins/20780509-2a07-4f1e-b268-b801f7532fac?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=77d4e32f92ef53dfb34d95fbb3b45e18", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、@Artistreccsのツイッターであなたのアートを見ました！友人のVTuberのアートを探しています！彼はやんちゃで元気で遊び好きな性格のドラゴンの男の子です。彼の性格は漫画極楽街のアルマに似ています。サメの歯が生えている。後ろ髪はポニーテール。\nキャラクターの参考資料が入ったグーグルドライブのフォルダを添付します！よろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1y3lNUJdLzGstu5VcJIfUwoHnCAuBwZgJ?usp=drive_link", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@illust__ai/works/29", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3644635, "client_id": 3596750, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_i